## Threading & UObject access

Do not read or mutate `UObject` state from worker threads without explicit game-thread marshaling. Treat async work touching assets or actors as **high risk**—document in plan/review when unavoidable.

## Soft references & asset paths

Prefer **`TSoftObjectPtr<T>`** / **`TSoftClassPtr<T>`** for optional assets loaded on demand; pair with `LoadSynchronous` or async loaders per project patterns. Use **`TSubclassOf<UObject>`** for typed class references instead of bare `UClass*` when null safety matters for Blueprint-exposed APIs.
